750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) (R) shelves in dry storage (sugar on shelves holding cotton candy sugar and register tape);  
B) (R) drain line under ice machine (mold);
C) drain line under soda machine (mold);
D) cabinets below buffet/salad bar (food debris/splash);
E) bottom inside reach-in salad cooler (food debris/splash);
F) sliding door cooler - pizza racks (food debris) & bottom inside/tracks of doors (food debris);  and
G) bottom inside 2 door freezer (food debris).

Clean all non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
